        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is the minimum order quantity for corporate uniforms?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Our minimum order quantity for custom corporate uniforms is 300 pieces per style. This minimum allows you to access factory-direct pricing while outfitting teams of various sizes. The 300-piece minimum can be distributed across sizes within a single colorway. For uniform sets counted as single styles, the minimum applies to the complete set. Lower quantities are available for sampling and prototype development at higher per-piece costs for companies requiring smaller initial orders."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What fabric options do you offer for corporate uniforms?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "We offer cotton/polyester blends for durability and wrinkle resistance (180-220 GSM), performance fabrics with moisture-wicking for active roles (160-200 GSM), flame-resistant fabrics for industrial safety (200-250 GSM), and eco-friendly options including organic cotton for sustainability. All fabrics are tested for durability and professional appearance. Fabric selection depends on industry requirements, work environment, comfort needs, and branding considerations, with flame-resistant options for hazardous environments."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What corporate uniform products can you manufacture?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "We manufacture dress shirts and blouses for professional settings, polo shirts for casual corporate environments, trousers and pants including chinos and dress pants, jackets and blazers for formal roles, aprons and workwear for service industries, and caps and accessories for complete branding. We produce uniforms for various industries including hospitality, healthcare, retail, corporate offices, and industrial settings. Our facility handles both simple uniform items and more complex constructions with specialized features."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Do you offer branding and embroidery services for uniforms?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. We offer comprehensive branding services including embroidery for logos and names, screen printing for larger designs, heat transfer for complex graphics, and woven labels for branding. Embroidery is the most popular choice for corporate uniforms due to its professional appearance and durability. We provide guidance on optimal branding placement and sizing based on garment type and design requirements. Branding services are quoted separately from garment costs, with pricing based on design complexity and quantity."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What industries do you serve with corporate uniforms?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "We serve diverse industries including hospitality (hotels, restaurants, cafes), healthcare (clinics, hospitals, care facilities), retail stores and chains, corporate offices and professional services, industrial and manufacturing facilities, and educational institutions. Each industry has specific uniform requirements from stain resistance in hospitality to antimicrobial properties in healthcare. We understand these industry-specific requirements and can recommend appropriate fabrics and constructions for each sector."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How long does corporate uniform production take?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Standard production timeline is 30-40 days from fabric receipt for basic uniform items such as polo shirts and trousers. Shirts and blouses typically require 35-45 days. Custom fabric development adds 15-20 days. Sampling takes 15-20 days before bulk production approval. Complex items with specialized features like flame resistance may require 40-50 days production time. We recommend planning 60-75 days total from initial inquiry to delivery for first-time orders including sampling and production."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "Service",
      "name": "Corporate Uniform Manufacturing Service",
      "description": "Custom corporate uniform manufacturing from 300 pieces including shirts, polos, trousers, workwear with embroidery and branding options",
      "provider": {
        "@id": "https://sdfltd.com/#org"
      },
      "areaServed": ["United States", "United Kingdom", "European Union", "Canada", "Australia"],
      "hasOfferCatalog": {
        "@type": "OfferCatalog",
        "name": "Corporate Uniform Manufacturing Services",
        "itemListElement": [
          {
            "@type": "Offer",
            "itemOffered": {
              "@type": "Service",
              "name": "Custom Corporate Uniform Production"
            },
            "priceSpecification": {
              "@type": "PriceSpecification",
              "priceCurrency": "USD",
              "minPrice": "8",
              "maxPrice": "25"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowTo",
      "name": "How to Order Custom Corporate Uniforms from SDF Clothing",
      "description": "Step-by-step process for ordering custom corporate uniforms from our Bangladesh manufacturing facility",
      "step": [
        {
          "@type": "HowToStep",
          "name": "Submit Design Requirements",
          "text": "Send your uniform design, fabric preferences, garment type, size chart, branding requirements, and target quantity via contact form"
        },
        {
          "@type": "HowToStep",
          "name": "Receive Detailed Quote",
          "text": "Get pricing within 24-48 hours including fabric costs, production, branding, and shipping for your uniform order"
        },
        {
          "@type": "HowToStep",
          "name": "Approve Samples",
          "text": "Review uniform samples for fit, fabric quality, construction, and branding placement within 15-20 days before bulk production"
        },
        {
          "@type": "HowToStep",
          "name": "Bulk Production",
          "text": "Production begins after sample approval with 30-40 day turnaround for standard uniform items"
        },
        {
          "@type": "HowToStep",
          "name": "Quality Inspection & Shipping",
          "text": "Final quality check before shipment with tracking documentation for your corporate uniform order"
        }
      ]
