  </section>

  <section class="trust">
    <div class="trust__container">
      <div class="trust__items">
        <div class="trust__item">
          <span class="trust__icon">?</span>
          <span>ISO 9001 Quality</span>
        </div>
        <div class="trust__item">
          <span class="trust__icon">?</span>
          <span>BSCI Social Compliance</span>
        </div>
        <div class="trust__item">
          <span class="trust__icon">?</span>
          <span>OEKO-TEX Standard 100</span>
        </div>
        <div class="trust__item">
          <span class="trust__icon">?</span>
          <span>Embroidery Available</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section__container">
      <div class="section__header">
        <span class="section__label">Introduction</span>
        <div class="accent-line"></div>
        <h2 class="section__title">Corporate Uniform Manufacturer for Professional Workwear</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="section__text">
        <p>As a specialized corporate uniform manufacturer based in Bangladesh, SDF Clothing understands that professional workwear requires durability, consistent appearance, and comfort for all-day wear. The corporate uniform market encompasses diverse needs from professional office attire to industrial workwear, requiring expertise in various fabric types and construction methods. Our facility delivers on these requirements with minimum orders of 300 pieces, making professional uniform manufacturing accessible to businesses of all sizes.</p>
        
        <p>Bangladesh has established itself as a competitive sourcing destination for corporate uniforms and workwear, combining cost advantages with developing expertise in professional garment production. Our corporate uniform production leverages Bangladesh's textile ecosystem, offering international brands access to skilled labor, established supply chains for professional fabrics, and comprehensive manufacturing capabilities. The 300-piece minimum enables businesses to outfit teams without committing to large inventory positions, reducing risk while accessing factory-direct pricing.</p>
        
        <p>Our corporate uniform manufacturing addresses the specific requirements of professional workwear: durable fabrics that withstand frequent industrial laundering, consistent sizing for uniform appearance across teams, comfortable construction for all-day wear, professional styling appropriate for business environments, and branding options for corporate identity. We work with cotton/polyester blends, performance fabrics, and flame-resistant materials to meet various industry requirements while maintaining OEKO-TEX certification for chemical safety.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--alt">
    <div class="section__container">
      <div class="section__header">
        <span class="section__label">Product Range</span>
        <div class="accent-line"></div>
        <h2 class="section__title">What We Manufacture</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="section__text">
        <p>Our corporate uniform production encompasses multiple product categories designed for different industries and professional environments. Each category maintains our commitment to quality fabrics and durable construction while offering distinct functional and aesthetic characteristics. We manufacture all categories from 300 pieces minimum, with the ability to mix categories within larger orders for complete uniform programs.</p>
        
        <p>Dress shirts and blouses represent our core professional category, including long-sleeve dress shirts for formal environments, short-sleeve shirts for warmer climates or casual business settings, and blouses with various necklines for women's professional wear. We produce classic button-front shirts, spread collar styles for modern professional appearance, and variations with cuff options. Dress shirts use woven fabrics like cotton/polyester blends in weights ranging from 180-220 GSM. Construction emphasizes durable seams and secure button attachment. Dress shirts are essential professional wear for corporate offices and customer-facing roles.</p>
        
        <p>Polo shirts provide casual professional wear appropriate for many business environments. We produce classic pique polo shirts with collars, interlock polo shirts for smoother appearance, and performance polos with moisture-wicking for active roles. Polo shirts use knit fabrics in weights ranging from 160-200 GSM, with performance options incorporating moisture management. Construction includes reinforced collar bands and secure placket construction. Polo shirts are popular in hospitality, retail, and corporate casual environments where professional appearance meets comfort.</p>
        
        <p>Trousers and pants include dress pants for formal settings, chinos for business casual environments, and industrial pants with specialized features. We produce dress pants with pleats or flat fronts, chinos in various colors for casual business wear, and industrial pants with reinforced knees and utility pockets. These items use woven fabrics ranging from 200-250 GSM for durability. Construction emphasizes durable seams and secure closures. Trousers require careful attention to fit consistency across sizes to ensure uniform appearance within teams.</p>
        
        <p>Jackets and blazers provide outer layers for formal professional environments or cooler conditions. We produce blazers for formal business attire, soft shell jackets for active professional roles, and industrial jackets with safety features. Jackets use appropriate fabrics including woven materials for blazers and performance fabrics for active jackets. Construction varies by style, with blazers requiring tailored construction and industrial jackets requiring specialized features. Jackets are ideal for completing professional uniform programs and providing seasonal versatility.</p>
        
        <p>Aprons and workwear serve service industries including restaurants, cafes, healthcare, and hospitality. We produce bib aprons with neck and waist ties, waist aprons for kitchen staff, and specialized workwear with industry-specific features. These items use durable fabrics often with stain-resistant treatments in weights ranging from 180-220 GSM. Construction emphasizes durability and easy laundering. Aprons and workwear require specialized features like pockets and stain resistance appropriate to specific industries.</p>
        
        <p>Caps and accessories complete uniform programs with branded headwear and complementary items. We produce baseball caps with embroidery, visors for outdoor roles, and branded accessories like ties, belts, and scarves where appropriate. These items use materials suitable to their intended use, with caps typically using structured fabrics and accessories using professional materials. Branding on caps and accessories reinforces corporate identity throughout the uniform program.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="comparison-wrapper">
        <table class="comparison">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Category</th>
              <th>Fabric GSM</th>
              <th>Key Features</th>
              <th>Best For</th>
              <th>Price Tier</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="comparison__row--highlight">
              <td>Dress Shirts & Blouses</td>
              <td>180-220</td>
              <td>Professional, formal, durable</td>
              <td>Corporate offices, professional</td>
              <td>$$</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
